{"type":"text","timestamp":1793461665141,"sessionID":"ses_e6d6514fcffe8tXblUpqWJRce4","part":{"id":"prt_192a53b4e001X24dolpx4jrsRb","sessionID":"ses_e6d6514fcffe8tXblUpqWJRce4","messageID":"msg_192a5339c001DZPmILDMdBWZNn","type":"text","text":"{\"partition_id\": \"p1\", \"files_changed\": [\"packages/core_playlist/lib/core_playlist.dart\", \"packages/core_playlist/test/core_playlist_test.dart\", \"packages/core_playlist/README.md\", \"packages/infra_signed_urls/lib/src/firebase_delivery_client.dart\", \"packages/infra_signed_urls/test/backend_contract_fixture_test.dart\", \"packages/infra_signed_urls/test/live_delivery_test.dart\", \"packages/infra_firestore/test/firebase_manifest_source_test.dart\", \"packages/kernel_app/test/backend_delivery_contract_test.dart\", \"packages/kernel_app/test/prepare_playback_test.dart\", \"backend/functions/src/config.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/contracts.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/auth.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/host_join.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/host_media.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/delivery.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/publish.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/guest_upload.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/retention.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/runtime.ts\", \"backend/functions/src/index.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/contracts.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/backend_contract_fixture.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/delivery.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/host_join.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/host_media.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/host_admin_e2e.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/guest_upload.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/retention.test.ts\", \"backend/functions/test/security_rules.test.ts\", \"test/fixtures/cctv_counts_v1.json\", \"test/fixtures/join_roles_v1.json\", \"docs/backend-contract-v1.md\"], \"tests_run\": [\"backend: npm run build (tsc clean)\", \"backend: npm run test:emulator (127 pass, 0 fail, 0 skipped; includes contracts, fixture incl. legacy 4-camera hash preservation, delivery incl. 2-camera exact ACK, generation, host_join, host_media, host_admin_e2e with fixture-backed real generation, guest_upload incl. host-preview withdrawal, retention incl. preview protection/expiry, security_rules incl. host deny, plus all pre-existing suites)\", \"dart: flutter test packages/core_playlist (32 pass) + dart analyze (clean)\", \"dart: flutter test packages/infra_firestore (7 pass) + dart analyze (clean)\", \"dart: flutter test packages/infra_signed_urls (8 pass) + dart analyze (clean)\", \"dart: flutter test packages/kernel_app prepare_playback (12 pass) + backend_delivery_contract (2 pass) + dart analyze (clean)\"], \"tests_passed\": \"all: backend emulator 127/127 pass 0 skipped; Dart core_playlist 32/32, infra_firestore 7/7, infra_signed_urls 8/8, kernel_app 14/14; analyzers clean\", \"summary\": \"p1 done. Camera contracts: shared 1/2/4 first-N prefix helpers in core_playlist (kSupportedCctvClipCounts, expectedCctvCameraIds) and backend (SUPPORTED_CAMERA_COUNTS, expectedCameraIds); Dart + backend manifest validators accept exactly 1/2/4 with unique clip IDs and first-N camera sets, reordered OK, rejecting unsupported counts/gaps/duplicates/unknown cameras/bad metadata; Dart delivery URL/ACK and backend parseAck/accepted-ACK replay enforce exact prefix match including extra-hash rejection; legacy 4-camera fixture hashes and ACK idempotency preserved. Host admin: new host_join.ts (TV-only short-lived invite, token-hash storage, transactional host-role redemption, idempotent retry, replay/expiry/PIN/role-forgery/cross-party denial, guest-only legacy joinParty) and host_media.ts seed catalog (fixed-preset queue reuse, separately referenced TTL-limited previews signed on demand and surviving ACK purge, per-seed deletion with manifest revocation and accounting preservation, tombstone-based publish/race protection); auth gates revalidate host role per op; withdrawal and retention integrate preview cleanup/protection; all six callables exported via runtime+index. Fixtures cctv_counts_v1/join_roles_v1 added; backend-contract-v1.md and core_playlist README document counts, host-entry rationale (dedicated HostEntryScreen), and catalog deletion/expiry. No files outside partition touched; nothing committed.\"}","time":{"start":1793461664591,"end":1793461665141}}}
